        "Abstract": "SberQuAD is a large scale Russian reading comprehension dataset created similarly to SQuAD. It contains 50K training examples, 15K development examples, and 25K testing examples. The dataset was created by selecting Wikipedia pages, splitting them into paragraphs, and presenting paragraphs to crowd workers who generated questions that can be answered using the content of the paragraph."
